{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Traveling Without Moving"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Shimunenga Ceremony"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe detailed facts about events or actions in work and social contexts, in written or spoken situations"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to mend "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to repair, especially with cloth"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Here and there, the clothing requires mending or cleaning."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a cultural festival."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "leopard skin"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the hide of a wild cat with spots"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The women's traditional leopard skin clothing needs to be brought out."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "full moon"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when the moon is seen as a full disc "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Also because the full moon hasn't arrived up to now. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "affair"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "matter; issue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The men stay in the villages, to relax and focus on land affairs that require discussing. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stick"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a longish slim piece of wood "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The women bring sticks, which symbolize spears that need to be thrown at the men. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mock battle "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a play fight"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: After that, there are other games, dancing, and mock battles that need to be enjoyed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to symbolize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stand for another thing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The sticks, which symbolize spears. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chief"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "head of the village"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Then, people move to the chief's palace for speeches and praise songs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to display"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to show"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: On Sunday, the best cattle from each family are to displayed to impress the neighbors."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le05ob10aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le05ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Passive Gerunds and Infinitives with Need, Require and Want"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use different rules of infinitives and gerunds when they come after the verbs <span class=\"italic\">need</span>, <span class=\"italic\">require</span> and <span class=\"italic\">want</span>.<br/>  The rule depends on if you want a passive or active meaning."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The verbs <span class=\"italic\">need</span>, <span class=\"italic\">require</span> and <span class=\"italic\">want</span> can be followed by the active or passive infinitives to express active or passive meanings."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">need to make</span> a quick call. (active meaning) <br/> Sometimes, people <span class=\"strong\">need to be told</span> a white lie. (passive meaning) </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">My job <span class=\"strong\">requires me to handle</span> many different personalities. (active meaning) <br/> They <span class=\"strong\">required the information to be sent </span>at the end of the day. (passive meaning) </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">wanted to stay</span> a little while longer. (active meaning) <br/> It was obvious that <span class=\"strong\">he wanted to be included</span>. (passive meaning)</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Active gerunds, however, after these verbs express passive meanings:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Your beard <span class=\"strong\">needs shaving</span>.</span> (It should be shaved.)<br/> <span class=\"italic\">These documents <span class=\"strong\">require</span> careful <span class=\"strong\">handling</span>.</span> (They should be handled carefully.)<br/> <span class=\"italic\">The tables <span class=\"strong\">want cleaning</span>.</span> (They should be cleaned.)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take a look at some examples from the text:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The women's traditional leopard skin clothing <span class=\"strong\">needs to be</span> brought out. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It <span class=\"strong\">needs to be</span> carefully looked at. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Every woman <span class=\"strong\">wants to be told</span> that her garment is beautiful. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Both of these are <span class=\"strong\">required to happen</span> before the ceremony can begin.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "There are spears that <span class=\"strong\">need to be</span> thrown at the men. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Appreciation gifts are <span class=\"strong\">required to be given to</span> performers."}, {"type": "example", "content": "After that, there are other games, dancing, and mock battles that <span class=\"strong\">need to be</span> enjoyed."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The young women <span class=\"strong\">need instructing</span> on how to dance."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Here and there the clothing <span class=\"strong\">requires mending</span> or <span class=\"strong\">cleaning</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They focus on land affairs that <span class=\"strong\">require discussing</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "There are dances that <span class=\"strong\">need doing</span> and songs that <span class=\"strong\">need singing</span>."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Present Perfect for Unusual Events: Review"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Present Perfect tense in a variety of ways to connect the past with the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the chart for a review of some ways to use the Present Perfect tense and what kind of words you commonly use with it."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Words Commonly Used With It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To talk or ask about events in the recent past, that may still be happening\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">only just <br/>so far<br/> up to now</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Have you only just been told</span> it happens this weekend?<br/> How much <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have you found out so far</span>? <br/> Also because the full moon <span class=\\\"strong\\\">hasn't arrived up to now</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To talk or ask about experience\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ever</span> (in questions) <span class=\\\"italic\\\">yet </span>(negatives)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Have you ever wanted</span> to experience the Shimunenga? <br/> The Shimunenga <span class=\\\"strong\\\">hasn't begun yet</span>!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have you</span> recently <span class=\"strong\">arrived</span> in Namwala?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have you</span> ever <span class=\"strong\">wanted</span> to experience the Shimunenga? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have you</span> only just <span class=\"strong\">been told</span> it happens this weekend?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Has</span> the first rain of the season just <span class=\"strong\">fallen</span>? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have you</span> ever <span class=\"strong\">been</span> part of such an exciting event?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "How much <span class=\"strong\">have you found</span> out so far? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">haven't been</span> to one myself up to now!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Also because the full moon <span class=\"strong\">hasn't arrived</span> up to now."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ask family members about cultural activities that they used to participate in or find out about a cultural event at the library."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out where, when and why this event happens in your country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out who usually goes and what they can expect to do there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Put together a poster letting people know about the event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the poster to practice talking about the event"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Bring your poster to class and tell other students about the event."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find out about a cultural event in my country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I answer <span class=\"italic\">wh</span>- questions while I find information about the event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I put together a poster to tell people about the event. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the poster to tell people in my class about the event."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le05ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le05ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "The Shimunenga hasn't begun yet! The women's traditional leopard skin clothing needs to be brought out. It needs to be carefully looked at. Here and there, the clothing requires mending or cleaning. Every woman wants to be told that her garment is beautiful. The young women need instructing on how to dance.<br/>Have you recently arrived in Namwala? Have you ever wanted to experience the Shimunenga? Have you only just been told it happens this weekend? How much have you found out so far? I haven't been to one myself up to now!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Has the first rain of the season just fallen? Yes, it has! That's why the ceremony takes place this weekend. Also because the full moon hasn't arrived up to now. Both of these are required to happen before the ceremony can begin.  <br/>On Friday, the women sing and dance, while the men stay in the villages, to relax and focus on land affairs that require discussing. <br/>On Saturday, the men's day, the women bring sticks, which symbolize spears that need to be thrown at the men. There are dances that need doing and songs that need singing.", "id": 2, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Appreciation gifts are required to be given to performers. Then, people move to the chief\u0092's palace for speeches and praise songs. This is a time for songs and games.<br/>On Sunday, the best cattle from each family are displayed to impress the neighbors. After that, there are other games, dancing, and mock battles that need to be enjoyed.<br/>Have you ever been part of such an exciting event? Come along. We can enjoy it together.", "id": 3, "time": "74000", "image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about different cultures, civilizations, and social issues."}, {"type": "Le